    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong>This is the prologue of DragonLoop.<br>The prologue version is the first hour of the official edition.<br>DragonLoop is a 5-day timeloop metroidvania, with the prologue being a specially customized 3-day timeloop of 1 hour content. Players will be able to play some of the areas in this episode over a 3-day timeloop.<br>Please wishlist the DragonLoop if you like this game.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/4056e9662770ae34fd168becc50fdf10.avif?t=1747829601\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>The heroine who lost her memory was trapped in a five-day loop.<br>Together with your partner, travel through a world with strange time changes, escape from reincarnation through exploration and combat, and learn the truth about the world!<br>In the cycle, you will regain your memory and continue to become stronger.<br>You can take advantage of new abilities, explore new areas, and defeat new enemies.<br>You can also go back to the old area, defeat enemies that are different from what you remember, and try to change your known destiny.<br>The game is a time loop Metroidvania.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b8f347b5ccf9ed40586d0b6ad8ad117f.poster.avif?t=1747829601\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b8f347b5ccf9ed40586d0b6ad8ad117f.webm?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b8f347b5ccf9ed40586d0b6ad8ad117f.mp4?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/1df739fe2707904fe82e170a8d4b3ef0.avif?t=1747829601\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>Change of time</strong><br>Dynamic world! Enemies, maps, NPCs... many contents will change over time. The game has a special timing method that allows you to explore as much as you want.<br><br><strong>Fight happily</strong><br>Easy-to-learn, fast-paced and smooth combat! Use the flexible [Link] to dash forward quickly, combine combos, and summon practical plants to assist in combat.<br><br><strong>Boss battle</strong><br>Use your powerful performance to engage in high-speed duels with dangerous bosses with different styles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b3971d9adb513dcaaabee3236debda74.poster.avif?t=1747829601\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b3971d9adb513dcaaabee3236debda74.webm?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b3971d9adb513dcaaabee3236debda74.mp4?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>This is the prologue of DragonLoop.<br>The prologue version is the first hour of the official edition.<br>DragonLoop is a 5-day timeloop metroidvania, with the prologue being a specially customized 3-day timeloop of 1 hour content. Players will be able to play some of the areas in this episode over a 3-day timeloop.<br>Please wishlist the DragonLoop if you like this game.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/4056e9662770ae34fd168becc50fdf10.avif?t=1747829601\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>The heroine who lost her memory was trapped in a five-day loop.<br>Together with your partner, travel through a world with strange time changes, escape from reincarnation through exploration and combat, and learn the truth about the world!<br>In the cycle, you will regain your memory and continue to become stronger.<br>You can take advantage of new abilities, explore new areas, and defeat new enemies.<br>You can also go back to the old area, defeat enemies that are different from what you remember, and try to change your known destiny.<br>The game is a time loop Metroidvania.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b8f347b5ccf9ed40586d0b6ad8ad117f.poster.avif?t=1747829601\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b8f347b5ccf9ed40586d0b6ad8ad117f.webm?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b8f347b5ccf9ed40586d0b6ad8ad117f.mp4?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/1df739fe2707904fe82e170a8d4b3ef0.avif?t=1747829601\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>Change of time</strong><br>Dynamic world! Enemies, maps, NPCs... many contents will change over time. The game has a special timing method that allows you to explore as much as you want.<br><br><strong>Fight happily</strong><br>Easy-to-learn, fast-paced and smooth combat! Use the flexible [Link] to dash forward quickly, combine combos, and summon practical plants to assist in combat.<br><br><strong>Boss battle</strong><br>Use your powerful performance to engage in high-speed duels with dangerous bosses with different styles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b3971d9adb513dcaaabee3236debda74.poster.avif?t=1747829601\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b3971d9adb513dcaaabee3236debda74.webm?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781190/extras/b3971d9adb513dcaaabee3236debda74.mp4?t=1747829601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
